  "description": "Why does dating have to be like playing the lottery? So many duds and so few winners. All Hye-ji wants is to find some satisfaction in her life. But after a horrible breakup followed by a disappointing one-night stand, she has all but given up on love. That is, until her old friend Hye-sung invites her to come drink and meet his friends. Maybe a good night out is what Hye-ji needs to get out of her funk! Will she finally hit the jackpot and find a guy who loves her AND satisfies her in bed? Or will she realize that she's been holding the winning ticket this whole time…? \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
